>I was wondering what Cha affect. How does one improve Cha anyways?

  Ring of adornment and blessed potions of Gain Ability.  Also magic
trap dancing.  One of the possible effects of a magic trap is +1 to your
Charisma.  You will also instantly tame any adjacent monsters when this
happens.  You may get multiple Cha gains from a given trap before it
explodes.  You may not get any.  When the magic trap explodes you'll get
a Mana boost.

  The big problem with magic trap dancing is fire damage to equipment,
inventory, and your character.  Any non-fire-resistant armor should be
expendable.  If your character doesn't have intrinsic fire resistance
flame damage will lower max hit points.

  Charisma also affects shop prices.

